English: To reset a Gmail password, use Google's official Account Recovery page:

[Google Account Recovery](https://accounts.google.com/signin/recovery?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

The recovery flow verifies account ownership before allowing a new password. Avoid third-party “Gmail password recovery” services and never give anyone your verification code or password.

Developer note: For an application that integrates with Gmail, the correct approach is Google OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect, not storing or handling the user's Gmail password.